ent_id": 300145, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/03323e25/uploads/origins/005a870c-c4ba-4193-9847-392df02d491e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9dc65687657cc07b9c3b30073f987787", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/03323e25/uploads/origins/005a870c-c4ba-4193-9847-392df02d491e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8727f149758049503457815087df0568", "src_set": ""}, "body": "オレンジ色のビキニを着た私のオリジナルキャラクターを描いてください。セクシーなポーズで。\n目の色：グレー\n\n身長: 5'9 \"\n\n年齢: 20\n\n犬耳\n\nアクセサリー：赤い首輪\n\n背景: ビーチ\n\nポーズ: セクシー\n\n表情：浮気\n\n私のオリジナルキャラクターの参考文献はこちら: https://www.deviantart.com/citrusanime/art/My-Offical-DA-Mascot-290687270\n\n他のアーティスト 1. https://sta.sh/023ht6z36vqf 2. https://sta.sh/0278r2mg6ixd 3. https://sta.sh/0k1ja8v3adq\n\nポーズの参考文献 1. https://sta.sh/0ufsyy8di0d 2. https://sta.sh/0sozjsty4p7 3. https://sta.sh/01hzsy3ciyyy\n\nセクシーに描いてください。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hiragi_amo/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1299770, "client_id": 2773440, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/124e083d/uploads/origins/1bee65e8-ef4e-43e9-837d-94c0f6fa8333?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ace577f6a715b4ef51d7e78a11091c4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/124e083d/uploads/origins/1bee65e8-ef4e-43e9-837d-94c0f6fa8333?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=54614312a089c0cbfd0d887ec1a431bb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "柊あも 様\n\n　いつも大変お世話になっております。滝沢です。\n\n　すべての絵が！最高最高最高！！！！なのでリクエストいたします。\n\n　ウマ娘から競馬にのめり込んでしまったのですが、一番すきなウマ娘がエイシンフラッシュなのです。しまいの足があって上がり最速の馬は最高！そしてビジュアルが大変よい。ぜひ、あもさんに描いていただけますと幸甚に存じます。\n\n・ウマ娘のエイシンフラッシュさんのイラストをお願いいたします。\n・服装や表情、背景、構図等はおまかせいたします。\n\n\n（もしエイシンフラッシュさんが尊すぎてアグネスデジタルなときは、\nﾓｰｲって鳴いてるプボくんのイラストをお願いいたします。）\n\n\n何卒よろしくお願いいたします。\n\n\\ ﾓｰｲ /\n 滝沢", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hiragi_amo/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1299770, "client_id": 1989717, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1304ac77/uploads/origins/e8b90f26-a238-41f6-a5cc-4c8c6e7028d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d77517480b4a2204cc4dfdbb8915bbae", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1304ac77/uploads/origins/e8b90f26-a238-41f6-a5cc-4c8c6e7028d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9a9e7f7d1e041ed7fc0a1952319745e6", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, please excuse the sudden request! I saw your artwork and I love how pretty it is and how you draw women! I would like to request for you to draw my one character. She is an older sister type fox who wears red glasses and has blonde hair. Please note the beauty mark under her lip as well. \n\nI would like for her to wear a red dress you think she would look good in. Please feel free to choose any pose and expression as well, but I would like the image to be alluring. \n\nThank you for your consideration! \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XTDbqDFYm3_xccyElOafQSWVgenKES1-?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hiragi_amo/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d4dc18b/uploads/origins/7a04e92c-d775-4ca4-91f1-0237cda71c04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=20